<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Boise Gems | Home</title>
    <%- include("includes/head") %>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <%- include("includes/header") %>
    </header>
    <div style="background-image: url('img/photos/boise-gems-11.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
        <div style="align-items: center; min-height: 380px;" class="double-to-single">
            <div style="text-align: right; padding: 16px; text-align: center;">
                <img src="/img/ui/text-logo.png" alt="Boise Gems text logo" style="width: 80%; filter: drop-shadow(2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.6));">
            </div>
            <div class="hidden-mobile">
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="background-color: var(--light-quarter);">
        <div style="padding: clamp(12px, 2vw, 32px);">
            <div class="intro-blurb" style="align-items: center;">
                <div style="padding: 64px 32px; font-size: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem);">
                    <p>Founded in 2022 to bring the marching arts back to the region, the Gems are a growing performing arts organization built on hard work, creativity, and performer-focused design. We’re a team of students, educators, and designers who believe that every season should push us further in skill, in confidence, and in connection. Our shows are built to challenge and inspire, and our culture puts performers first. Whether you're from across the country or in Southern Idaho, there's a place for you here. <br><br><b>Esto Perpetua.</b></p>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden-mobile">
                    <img src="/img/ui/gem.png" alt="Gems drum and bugle corps logo." class="hidden-mobile">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
        <div class="purple-storm">
            <div style="padding: 64px 0;">
                <h2 style="color: var(--light-half); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); text-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);">JOIN THE 2026 SEASON</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="duple-to-single">
                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: var(--light-half); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); text-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);">Join the Drum and Bugle Corps</h3>
                    <br>
                    <div class="image-wrapper">
                        <img src="/img/photos/boise-gems-15.jpg" alt="Phot of the Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps" style="max-height: 348px; object-fit: cover;">
                    </div>
                    <div style="padding: 48px 0;">
                        <a href="/join-corps" class="round-button">More Info</a>
                    </div>
                     <br>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: var(--light-half); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); text-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);">Join Boise Gems Independent</h3>
                    <br>
                    <div class="image-wrapper">
                        <img src="/img/photos/boise-gems-24.jpg" alt="Phot of the Boise Gems Independent" style="max-height: 348px; object-fit: cover;">
                    </div>
                    <div style="padding: 48px 0;">
                        <a href="/join-independent" class="round-button">More Info</a>
                    </div>
                     <br>
                </div>
                <br>
                <br>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 64px 0; background-color: var(--light-quarter);">
            <div class="duple-to-single">
                <div>
                    <h2 style="color: var(--dark-half); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);">Support Our Ensembles</h2>
                    <br>
                    <p style="padding: 16px 32px; text-align: left; font-size: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.4rem);">We're always looking for help and support. If you would like to donate, volunteer, or serve in any other way, we're more than accepting of your help! Donations and volunteers keep our ensembles running smoothly. There are many ways you can help out our organization! Keeping our ensembles well fed, transported, and equipped with instruments, uniforms, flags, etc, is expensive. We try our best to keep tuition costs low. Your donations can help with that!</p>
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    <a href="/donate" class="round-button">Show your support!</a>
                    <br>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="image-wrapper">
                        <img src="/img/photos/boise-gems-26.jpg" alt="Phot of the Boise Gems Independent">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="purple-storm-2" style="padding: 8px;">
            <div class="triple-to-duple">
                <% events.forEach(event => { %>
                    <div>
                        <div class="event-card" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="window.location='/event/<%= event.slug %>'">
                            <div style="text-align: center;">
                                <img src="img/publicupload/<%= event.image %>" alt="Cover for boise gems event, <%= event.title %>">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h2 style="text-align: left;"><%= event.title %></h2>
                                <small style="text-align: left;"><%= event.type %> <% if(event.cost) { %> <span style="color: var(--dark-half)">|</span> <span style="color: rgb(15, 190, 41)"><%= (event.cost).toLocaleString('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD' }) %>
                                </span><% } %></small>
                                <br>
                                <br>
                                <p><%= new Date(event.datetime).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' }) %></p>
                                <p><%= new Date(event.datetime).toLocaleTimeString('en-US', { hour: 'numeric', minute: '2-digit', hour12: true }) %></p>
                                <small><%= event.location %></small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                <% })%>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <footer>
        <%- include("includes/footer") %>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>